{"id":"n15698-2-8","stage":3,"title":"비바람 · 暴风雨","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15698-2-8-1","ko":"엄마, 학교 다녀오겠습니다.","zh":"妈妈，我去上学了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀오겠습니다.","meaning":"去一趟，去一下","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去一下；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"2","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀오겠습니다","audio":"/audio/d7d7ddf5efb74343ca5f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去一下","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"为做某事而去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/68700f13a8f2f2b55769.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15698-2-8-2","ko":"우산은 챙겼니? 오늘 밤에는 비바람이 친다고 하니 일찍 들어오너라.","zh":"带伞了吗？听说今晚有风雨，早点回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우산은","meaning":"雨伞","explanation":"우산：雨伞；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"우산","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71103","senseId":"1","lemma":"우산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우산은","audio":"/audio/563fb09ac6643a4e822e.mp3"}},{"text":"챙겼니?","meaning":"收拾，整理，准备","explanation":"챙기다：收拾，整理，准备；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"챙기다","audio":"/audio/39b299d8d470abe5d844.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29778","senseId":"1","lemma":"챙기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"챙겼니","audio":"/audio/5098a7df952d90767e4e.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"밤에는","meaning":"夜，夜间","explanation":"밤：夜，夜间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"밤","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74178","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밤에는","audio":"/audio/8eb937371c89529e0be8.mp3"}},{"text":"비바람이","meaning":"暴风雨","explanation":"비바람：暴风雨；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비바람","audio":"/audio/ad5402fd9b412b360d3d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15698","senseId":"2","lemma":"비바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비바람이","audio":"/audio/8a67a24b0a8e71cf1e9b.mp3"}},{"text":"친다고","meaning":"吹，大作","explanation":"치다：吹，大作；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28127","senseId":"1","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친다고","audio":"/audio/f66035116f1facd65bd4.mp3"}},{"text":"하니","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하니","audio":"/audio/917bc632330b55c71985.mp3"}},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿。","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}},{"text":"들어오너라.","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；너라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어오너라","audio":"/audio/51382c9ffb9787442033.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8b6f9142a49be500","term":"우산","zh":"雨伞","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3","entryId":"71103","definition":"在长竿上铺上像遮盖物一样的膜，下雨时用手举着遮雨的工具。","pronunciation":["우ː산"]},{"id":"39b299d8d470abe5","term":"챙기다","zh":"收拾，整理，准备","audio":"/audio/39b299d8d470abe5d844.mp3","entryId":"29778","definition":"寻找所需之物并携带，或观察是否携带齐全。","pronunciation":["챙기다"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"da9e530428ce1c2d","term":"밤","zh":"夜，夜间","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3","entryId":"74178","definition":"日落到第二天日出前的黑暗时段。","pronunciation":["밤"]},{"id":"ad5402fd9b412b36","term":"비바람","zh":"暴风雨","audio":"/audio/ad5402fd9b412b360d3d.mp3","entryId":"15698","definition":"同时袭来的猛烈的雨与强劲的风。","pronunciation":["비바람"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"吹，大作","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"28127","definition":"风强劲地吹或雨雪等下得很大。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/